       This generator creates a recursive function of surreals from their value
       on their left and right sets.  (Contributed by Scott Fenton,
       19-Aug-2024.) $)
    df-norec $a |- norec ( F ) =
     frecs ( { <. x , y >. |
     x e. ( ( _Left ` y ) u. ( _Right ` y ) ) } , No , F ) $.
