       induction and recursion across left and right sets.  To that end, we are
       going to develop a relationship ` R ` that is founded, partial, and
       set-like across the surreals.  This first theorem just establishes the
       value of ` R ` .  (Contributed by Scott Fenton, 19-Aug-2024.) $)
