      JKDELZMFUINFUIOAFPDEUIUIQZRDEUIUJTDEUIUJUAFUIABABUBFUIBUCCDEBUDUEUFUG $.

    $( Calculate the value of the surreal recursion operation.  (Contributed by
       Scott Fenton, 19-Aug-2024.) $)
    norecov $p |- ( A e. No ->
     ( F ` A ) = ( A G ( F |` ( ( _Left ` A ) u. ( _Right ` A ) ) ) ) ) $=
      ( vx vy csur wcel cfv cv cleft cright cun copab cpred cres co wfr wpo wse
