    $d B z m a b c d p q r s t u v w x y $.
    $( The value of surreal multiplication.  (Contributed by Scott Fenton,
       4-Feb-2025.) $)
    mulsval $p |- ( ( A e. No /\ B e. No ) -> ( A x.s B ) =
    ( ( { a | E. p e. ( _Left ` A ) E. q e. ( _Left ` B )
    a = ( ( ( p x.s B ) +s ( A x.s q ) ) -s ( p x.s q ) ) } u.
