         a = ( ( 1s +s ( ( xR -s A ) x.s yL ) ) /su xR ) } u.
       { a | E. xL e. { x e. ( _Left ` A ) | 0s <s x } E. yR e. r
         a = ( ( 1s +s ( ( xL -s A ) x.s yR ) ) /su xL ) } ) ) ,
