     16-Apr-2025.) $)
  abs0s $p |- ( abs_s ` 0s ) = 0s $=
    ( c0s csur wcel cles wbr cabss cfv wceq 0no lesid ax-mp abssid mp2an ) ABCZ
    AADEZAFGAHINOIAJKALM $.

  $( For a negative surreal, its absolute value is its negation.  (Contributed
