    ( c1s cadds co c2s cnns 1p1e2s wcel 1nns peano2nns ax-mp eqeltrri ) AABCZDE
    FAEGLEGHAIJK $.

  $( Surreal two is a surreal number.  (Contributed by Scott Fenton,
     23-Jul-2025.) $)
  2no $p |- 2s e. No $=
    ( c2s cnns wcel csur 2nns nnno ax-mp ) ABCADCEAFG $.

  $( Surreal two is nonzero.  (Contributed by Scott Fenton, 23-Jul-2025.) $)
  2ne0s $p |- 2s =/= 0s $=
    ( c2s cnns wcel c0s wne 2nns nnne0s ax-mp ) ABCADEFAGH $.

